# Optional pinned CA certificate bundle for Windows Authenticode verification
# (`osslsigncode verify -CAfile docs/release/windows-ca.pem`) on the macOS publish runner.
#
# Before tagging 1.0, Pasta can paste the root + intermediate PEM certificates of Dash Core's
# Windows code-signing CA here (for example, DigiCert Trusted Root G4 + DigiCert Trusted G4
# Code Signing RSA4096 SHA384 2021 CA1) so release-publish-signed.yml verifies against the
# exact CA bundle instead of Homebrew's default CA store.
#
# While this file contains no `-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----` blocks, release-publish-signed.yml
# falls back to Homebrew's default CA bundle. Once populated, ci/github/release-attach.sh
# passes `-CAfile docs/release/windows-ca.pem` to `osslsigncode`.
